  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/ns/sparql#version-1.2-basic">
    <dc:description>This is a version of SPARQL without triple terms, without triple patterns that have a triple pattern in their subject or object position, but otherwise with all 1.2 features and semantics.</dc:description>
